{
 "schema": "drawing-check-cases/1",
 "_doc": [
  "Server ports of the AutoCAD toolkit's ILCHECK rules (system_design/drawing_checks.py, WP 1.9).",
  "Each case is the parts of an ilq/2 package that matter; tests/portal_unit/test_drawing_checks.py fills the",
  "rest (schema, toolkit, catalog, drawing, check counts, run handles and types, control handles), applies",
  "ilq_schema.with_defaults, validates it unless schema_valid is false, and checks it against catalog.sample.json",
  "with catalog_patch merged in (objects merge by key; list items merge into the item with the same id, else",
  "the same code, else are appended). expected lists every issue of the ported codes (text when given);",
  "the same cases run through the LISP il-check for parity."
 ],
